  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "In this tutorial, you learned some basics of the Unity Editor interface, decreased the player's gravity, and playtested. \n\nNext, you\u2019ll start making your own changes!"
--- !u!114 &-6558190004878804611
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: 'Let''s test the new gravity! To jump, use the <b>space bar.</b>


      Before testing, remember to save your changes:


      In the top menu, go to <b>File</b> > <b>Save</b>, or use the shortcut <b>Ctrl</b> / <b>Cmd</b> + <b>S</b>.'
--- !u!114 &-5995266550503024678
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "Next, let\u2019s make the player jump higher!\n\nGo deeper:\n\n\u2022 Everything in your game world, including the player character, is called a <b>GameObject.</b>\n\n\u2022The <b>Hierarchy</b> is where you organize GameObjects \u2014 each one in your game is listed there.\n\n\u2022 Select a GameObject to find out more about it and configure its behavior."
