  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "In this tutorial, you\u2019ll begin to explore the basics of the Unity Editor as you:\n\n\u2022 Playtest the beginning of the FPS Microgame\n\u2022 Review the Unity Editor interface\n\u2022 Make the player character jump higher\n\nReady? Let's go!"
